 unsure of the identity of these items, he gets clues from his workman, [[Numbers]]. {{Source|TCG:SAS-089|SAS-089}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nHector is able to move long distances quite fast. He is also bonded to the powerful [[Iron Monkey]] Titan. {{Source|TCG:SAS-034|SAS-034}}\n\n===  Bonded Titans ===\n*[[Iron Monkey]]\n\n== Trivia ==\n*Hector is similar in appearance to [[Marduk]], a tracker of the [[Blood Spiral]]. \n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:TCG characters]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","TCG characters"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"TCG:SAS-034","label":" SAS-034","target_id":"huntik:page:5850","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-034","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5850"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Titan","label":"Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2010","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2010"},{"target_title":"Iron Monkey","label":"Iron Monkey","target_id":"huntik:page:3478","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Monkey","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3478"},{"target_title":"Numbers","label":"Numbers","target_id":"huntik:page:10977","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Numbers","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A10977"},{"target_title":"Iron Monkey","label":"Iron Monkey","target_id":"huntik:page:3478","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Monkey","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik